Tool response:
Tool: find_encounter_for_patient_yesterday
Description: Retrieve the encounter record for patient Jane Doe (MRN 67890) that occurred yesterday,
including associated SOAP note and diagnoses.
Note: The spec says 'yesterday', but provides an explicit date param. We use the provided date.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "mrn": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Medical Record Number of the patient",
          "title": "Mrn"
        },
        "encounter_date": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Date of the encounter in YYYY-MM-DD format",
          "title": "Encounter Date"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "mrn",
        "encounter_date"
      ]
    }

